-- requires: realizer
-- Human-facing name + one-line description per collection — the single data-driven seed for base_collection_meta
-- (kept out of the per-collection files so the ids there stay the source of truth for identity, not display). The
-- title is the no-underscore display name the explorer shows; the description is a short gloss. base_catalog LEFT
-- JOINs this, falling back to the id when a row is absent.

